  "sourceTitle": "Pineapple Pie Filling",
  "sourceText": "Pineapple Pie Filling\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, December 6, 2009 - 12:18am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 (No. 2) can crushed pineapple\n2 tablespoons cornstarch\n1/2 cup sugar\n1/4 teaspoon salt\n1 tablespoon butter\n1 tablespoon lemon juice\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cook first 4 ingredients until thick. Add butter and lemon juice. Cool slightly and pour into a baked pie shell and cool. Top with whipped cream.",
  "parsedSource": {
